==English==

===Etymology===
< {{etyl|la}} {{term|convolutus||to roll together}}, past participle of {{term|convolvere}} <  {{term|con-}} + {{term|volvere||to roll}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|uːʃən}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something that is [[folded]] or [[twisted]].
# Any of the [[fold]]s on the [[surface]] of the [[brain]].
# The shape of something [[rotating]]; a [[vortex]].
# {{mathematics}} A form of [[moving]] [[average]].
# {{computing}} A [[function]] that puts [[element]]s of multiple [[string]]s into [[array]]s.

